{"id":"e_tendue","lemma":"étendue","pos":"noun","rank":4957,"glosses":["expanse, area (of land, water etc.)","size (of a country, collection etc.)","scale, range, extent (of knowledge, damage etc.); depth (of ignorance)"],"ipa":"/e.tɑ̃.dy/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/96/Fr-%C3%A9tendue.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9tendue.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"étendues"},"formAudio":{"étendues":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-%C3%A9tendues.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Sa famille est très étendue.","en":"His family is very large.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"J'étais étendue sur mon lit.","en":"I lay on my bed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"bed"}]},{"text":"Notre influence s'est beaucoup étendue depuis lors.","en":"Our sphere of influence has expanded so much since then.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"influence"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"since then, ever since"]]},{"text":"Elle était étendue à plat ventre sur le lit.","en":"She was lying face down on the bed.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bed"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"face-down"]]},{"text":"Une personne âgée était étendue morte sur la route.","en":"An old man lay dead on the road.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"dead","l":"mort"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"road"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"senior citizen"]]}]}